    "title": "Oda's Counter",
    "subtitle": [
      "The Valley Scrip shop. Open from the moment the store reopens.",
      "Cozy work pays Scrip; Scrip deletes tech grind. Every line restocks.",
      "Stock arrives in tiers, and the tiers arrive on the rail line."
